"The constants used in I<modes> are prefixed with \"MOD_\" rather than "
"\"ADJ_\", and have the same suffixes (thus, B<MOD_OFFSET>, B<MOD_FREQUENCY>, "
"and so on), other than the exceptions noted in the following points."
