#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/ctime.3:341
msgid ""
"POSIX doesn't specify the parameters of B<ctime_r>()  to be I<restrict>; "
"that is specific to glibc."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/ctime.3:345
msgid ""
